  era: "Section 33 \xB7 Science and Technology \xB7 1940s \u2013 present"
  title: India's space missions
  text: Highlights include the satellite Aryabhata in 1975; Chandrayaan-1 in 2008, which found evidence of water on the Moon; Mangalyaan in 2013, the first Asian mission to reach Mars orbit; Chandrayaan-3's landing near the lunar south pole in 2023; and Aditya-L1, studying the Sun.
